BarTranslate for Omarchy is an independent native Linux implementation inspired
by BarTranslate by Thijmen Dam: https://github.com/ThijmenDam/BarTranslate
Reference revision: c4a5d345d6a3f1c5fa280933d0154421ca0151a3

The final implementation does not include the upstream Swift app, webview,
CSS or logos. Native QML and a bounded Python translation helper were written
for this port in 2026. Distributed under GPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE.

Repository scaffold and portable manifest validator were generated with
Build Omarchy Plugins (MIT), revision
26ee1e7fc57e4089daea57ff0c51e6a10659e401.
Its MIT notice is preserved in licenses/build-omarchy-plugins-MIT.txt.

Google supplies translation data. This independent port is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Google or the original BarTranslate author.
